  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-preview.1\n- Initial preview release\n- Platform-neutral Core: configuration, results, events, contracts, and DI extension\n- Camera access and lifecycle contract (ICameraProvider) with permission request support\n- Document detection contract (IDocumentDetector) with high-level sensitivity and performance knobs\n- Capture pipeline contract (ICapturePipeline) for perspective-corrected capture\n- Image enhancement contract (IImageProcessor)\n- PDF export contract (IPdfExporter) with programmatic byte generation and print dialog modes\n- FrameOptions with sensible defaults for zero-configuration scanning\n- Immutable result records: FrameScanResult, DetectionResult, CornerPoints, ImageDimensions\n- CameraPermission enum: NotDetermined, Granted, Denied\n- AddFrame DI extension (idempotent, order-independent)",
